                                                            <script>
                                                                const faqData = {
                                                                    general: [
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What is Metaverse NFT Marketplace Development?",
                                                                            a: "Metaverse NFT Marketplace Development is the process of building an immersive 3D trading platform where users navigate as avatars to browse, buy, sell, and showcase NFTs, including virtual land, avatar wearables, digital art, and experience tickets."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "How is a metaverse NFT marketplace different from a regular NFT marketplace?",
                                                                            a: "A regular NFT marketplace displays assets as images on a web page. A metaverse NFT marketplace presents assets inside a navigable 3D virtual world as users walk into galleries as avatars, inspect assets in three dimensions, and try on wearables on their avatar before purchase."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What types of NFTs can be traded on a metaverse NFT marketplace?",
                                                                            a: "Metaverse NFT marketplaces support virtual land parcels, avatar wearables (VRM format), 3D collectible objects (GLB/GLTF), in-world experience tickets, phygital physical product twins, digital art (2D and 3D), game items, and virtual event access tokens."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What blockchains do metaverse NFT marketplaces support?",
                                                                            a: "Our metaverse NFT marketplace platform development supports Ethereum, Polygon, Immutable X, BNB Chain, Solana, Flow, Arbitrum, and Base, with chain selection based on your target community's existing wallet preferences, gas cost requirements, and desired transaction speed."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What is cross-metaverse asset portability?",
                                                                            a: "Cross-metaverse asset portability allows an NFT purchased on one platform to be used or displayed in a different metaverse environment. We implement this using the VRM standard for avatar wearables and LayerZero or Wormhole bridge protocols for multi-chain NFT transfer."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What is a phygital NFT and how does it work in a metaverse marketplace?",
                                                                            a: "A phygital NFT links a physical product to an on-chain digital twin. Scanning the physical item's NFC chip or QR code triggers the digital twin NFT to appear in the user's metaverse avatar wallet. Transferring the physical item triggers an on-chain ownership transfer of the linked NFT."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "How long has Clarisco been building metaverse NFT marketplace platforms?",
                                                                            a: "Clarisco Solutions has delivered 80+ NFT and blockchain platforms across art, gaming, virtual real estate, fashion wearables, and phygital categories with metaverse-specific 3D world and avatar system development experience spanning custom browser-based worlds, VR environments, and cross-world integrations."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What is a white label metaverse NFT marketplace?",
                                                                            a: "A white-label metaverse NFT marketplace is a pre-built, pre-audited 3D trading platform that brands and platform operators deploy under their own name, visual identity, and domain without building 3D world engines, virtual land smart contracts, or avatar wearable systems from scratch."
                                                                        }
                                                                    ],

                                                                    business: [
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What 3D technology does Clarisco use to build metaverse NFT marketplaces?",
                                                                            a: "Our primary 3D engines are Babylon.js and Three.js for browser-accessible WebGL environments requiring no plugin installation, and Unity WebGL for clients with an existing Unity world export. We use the WebXR API for VR and AR browser support and integrate spatial audio using the Web Audio API."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "What NFT standards are used in metaverse marketplace smart contracts?",
                                                                            a: "We use ERC-721 for unique single NFTs, ERC-1155 for semi-fungible editions, ERC-2981 for on-chain royalty enforcement, and ERC-6551 for avatar wallets that hold items as a collection attached to the avatar NFT itself."
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            q: "How does the virtual land registry smart contract work?",
                                                                            a: "The land registry contract maps each parcel NFT to a unique coordinate pair in the virtual world (X, Y) or (X, Y, Z) depending on world dimensionality. Ownership transfer of the parcel NFT triggers a world-map ownership update."
                                                                        },
